I wake up early this morning.
Warm sunlight fills the bedroom.
I get out of bed.
I open the window.
It is good weather outside.
Then I go to the kitchen.
I make a quick breakfast.
I also make coffee.
Sitting on the chair, I drink the hot coffee.
I eat my breakfast.
Afterward, I take a shower.
I get dressed.
I put the laptop and a water bottle in my bag.
Now the time is eight o'clock.
I am ready to go to the office.
